        "@value": "<p><b>Includes a ticket to all 10 shows presented during the 2026-2027 Performance Series:</b>\n\n<li><b>Steve Poltz</b> - Thursday, September 10, 2026</li>\n<li><b>Steve Marriner</b> - Friday, October 16, 2026</li> \n<li><b>Tulua</b> - Sunday, October 25, 2026</li>\n<li><b>Little Miss Higgins</b> - Friday, October 30, 2026</li>\n<li><b>Jake's Gift</b> - November 1, 2026</li>\n<li><b>John Reischman</b> - Friday, January 22, 2027</li>\n<li><b>Over The Moon</b> - Saturday, February 20, 2027</li>\n<li><b>Lennie Gallant</b> - Sunday, April 11, 2027</li>\n<li><b>The Fugitives</b> - Saturday, April 17, 2027</li>\n<li><b>Secondhand Dreamcar</b> - Thursday, June 24, 2027</li>\n\n</p>\n\n\n"
