      {
        "@value": "<p>Get ready to celebrate the remarkable achievements of Alberta's business community at the prestigious Alberta Business Awards of Distinction 2026! On September 23, experience an evening of celebration, connection, and unforgettable moments in Leduc, AB.</p>\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {\n    display: block!important;\n}\n</style>"
