    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprowest.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1701043054"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "FMX World Tour"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "The FMX World Tour is an extreme action sport competition that was formed to tour, USA, Canada, & Mexico<br><br>\n    \nPro riders will participate in an intense competition, throwing out some of the most death-defying tricks ever seen in the freestyle moto-cross world. The competition will include BEST TRICK,   TEAM COMPETITIONS AND HEAD-TO-HEAD BACK FLIP COMPETITION & MORE!   Superman Seat Grabs, Cliff Hangers, Kiss of Death, Back Flips and Super Back Flips combinations are just some of the tricks that will be used to fight for the FMX World Tour' Championship. <br><br>\n    \nFMX World Tour' is HOME TO MANY STARS FROM NITRO CIRCUS, MONSTER ENERGY AND X-GAMES.  DON'T MISS THE STARS OF THE FMX WORLD TOUR AND THEIR FULL THROTTLE ACTION THAT WILL DEFY GRAVITY.  Watch as high flying FMX PROS compete to be on top and rock the EVERGREEN PARK RACEWAY. <br><br> \n    \nPit Party All FMX WORLD TOUR fans will receive FREE Pit Passes with advance ticket purchases will allow fans to come on the floor and meet the Stars.  <br><br>\n    \nVIP EXPERIENCE - GET INTO THE PIT PARTY 30 MINS EARLY - BEST SEATS IN THE HOUSE FREE FMX WORLD TOUR POSTER AND FREE LANYARD<br><br>\n  \n<b>Children 2 and UNDER ON LAP ARE FREE<br>\nChildren 12 AND OLDER = ADULT<br><br>\n\nTICKET PRICES INCREASE $5.00 Day off show!\n\n\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n.location-event-temp {display: none!important;}\n</style>\n"
      }
    ],
