    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Valdy"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "\n<p>Valdy has been part of the fabric of Canadian folk and pop\nmusic for over 50 years. A singer, guitarist, and songwriter,\nhe is remembered for 'Play Me a Rock and Roll Song,'\ninspired by his experience at the Aldergrove Rock Festival\nin 1968.</p>\n<p>Valdy has sold nearly half a million albums, earned two\nJuno Awards, seven Juno nominations, and four Gold\nalbums. Recent releases include Contenders with Gary\nFjellgaard and Viva Valdy: Live at Last.</p>\n<p>One of Canada's most influential songwriters, his music\nhas been recorded by artists including Quincy Jones\nand John Kay. He has toured internationally and remains\ncelebrated as one of Canada's purest and most credible\nstorytellers. </p>\n\n<p><a href='https://valdy.com/' target='_blank'>valdy.com</a></p>\n\n"
      }
    ],
