        "@value": "<p>Includes the following 5 shows of the 2026/2027 season</p>\n<p><b>The Heels</b>: Friday, October 2, 2026<br>\n<b>Secondhand Dreamcar</b>: Friday, November 6, 2026<br>\n<b>Bangs, Bobs & Banter: Confessions of a Hairstylist</b>: Friday, January 22, 2027<br>\n<b>Teagan Littlechief</b>: Friday, February 19, 2027<br>\n<b>The Wardens</b>: Friday, March 12, 2027</p>\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {\n    display: block!important;\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>"
