    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "The Frog Prince - Missoula Children's Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "\n<p>Deep in the royal swamp, a lonely Frog retrieves a\ngolden ball for Princess Prim in exchange for friendship.\nBut when the selfish princess refuses to keep her promise,\ntrouble begins. With help from Ollie the wise old Aspen\ntree, a well-read alligator, kindly Swamp Things, dancing\nflamingos, and more, Frog sets out to make things right.\nAlong the way, he discovers that true friendship is earned,\nnot bought, and that it is not what you are, but who\nyou are that counts. Filled with humour, music, and\ncolourful characters, this magical adventure is fun for\nthe whole family.</p>\n<p>Follow us on social media for audition details and\ngive your child the chance to be part of this magical\ntheatre experience!</p>\n\n<p><a href='https://www.mctinc.org/' target='_blank'>mctinc.org</a></p>\n\n"
      }
    ],
