    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>An Arts Club Theatre Company Presentation</p>\n\n<p>THE HILARIOUS HOLIDAY HIT</p>\n\n<p>The moms are back in the creative kitchen and ready to turn the 'season of giving' into the 'season of forgiving.' Enjoy a theatrical feast flavoured with big belly laughs, stuffed with dysfunction, and topped with a soupçon of sarcasm—all served on a platter of naked truth. Using their special recipe of raw humour and humanity, the moms prove that the holidays really are about family, however you define it.</p>\n\n<p>'Hallmark has nothing on this genuinely heartwarming show' —Stir Vancouver</p>\n\n<p>Mom's the Word: Talkin' Turkey was commissioned by the Arts Club Theatre Company, Vancouver, British Columbia, and received its world premiere at the Arts Club Theatre Company's Granville Island Stage in October 2022.</p>\n\t\t\t\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>\n"
