        "@value": "<p><u>Includes all 3 Evening Concerts this season:</u>\n<li><b>Tomatoes Tried to Kill Me But Banjos Saved my Life</b> - Friday, October 16, 2026 - 7:00 PM</li>\n<li><b>The Heels</b> - Saturday, December 12, 2026 - 7:00 PM</li>\n<li><b>JoAnna Rannelli - Bangs, Bobs and Banter</b> - Saturday, April 3, 2027 - 7:00 PM</li>\n</p>\n\n<style>\n.titleTax {display: none !important;}\n</style>"
