    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprowest.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1695925415/performances/HOR16JS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Canadian Steam Comedy presented by the Comedy Department (18+ ONLY)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p><b>18+ ONLY: Contains Adult Content.</b> </p>\n<p><b>Canadian Steam Comedy! with Mildly Sexy Lumberjacks!</b> </p> \n\n<p><b>It's Whose Line is it Anyway meets Magic Mike!</b> </p> \n\n<p>The cast of <i>Canadian Steam</i> has rocked stages at Just for Laughs, picked up Canadian Comedy Awards, and performed with Second City -appearing on CBC's <i>The Debaters</i>, Netflix, and Amazon Prime. Now they're bringing you a comedy show that's 100% Canadian and 1000% ridiculous.</p> \n\n<p><b>Canadian Steam: They're Polite, But Not Tonight.</b><br>\nThis maple syrup-fueled night of music and comedy features:\n<ul>\n<li>Hilarious improvised songs & sketch\n<li>Dangerously enthusiastic dance numbers\n<li>Exciting crowd work!\n<li>The perfect amount of  jaw-dropping  'eh'-rotica!\n<li>And plenty of Cheeky Canadian charm\n<li>Wicked Hoser Vibes!\n</ul></p> \n\n<p>From the creators at <b><a href='https://www.thecomedydepartment.com/' target='_blank'>The Comedy Department</a></b> - winners of the 2024, 2025 and 2026 TripAdvisor Travellers' Choice Award, this laugh-out-loud sexy spectacle has been delighting audiences everywhere. Check out these rave reviews! .</p> \n\n<p><b><a href='https://www.tripadvisor.ca/Attraction_Review-g154943-d24855142-Reviews-The_Comedy_Department-Vancouver_British_Columbia.html' target='_blank'>TripAdvisor 5-Star Reviews!</a></b> </p> \n\n\n<p><b>Cast Credits</b><br>\nThe Comedy Department ensemble are Canadian Comedy Award-winners who have toured internationally and performed alongside improv legends Colin Mochrie and Ryan Stiles. \n<ul>\n<li>Just for Laughs\n<li>Just For Laughs Vancouver\n<li>The Second City\n<li>The Improv Centre\n<li>Vancouver Theatre Sports League\n<li>The Comic Strippers\n<li>Underground Comedy Club\n<li>Yuk Yuks\n<li>Don't Tell Comedy\n<li>The Laugh Factory\n<li>The Improv\n<li>1000's of TV and in feature film credits\n</ul></p> \n\n<p><b>Come find out how funny they are in real life!</b></p> \n\n<p><b>Grab your tickets now -before the Ministry pulls the plug on their sexy mission.<br>\nFind out more! <a href='https://canadiansteamcomedy.com/' target='_blank'>Canadian Steam Website</a></b> </p> \n\n<p><b><a href='https://www.thecomedydepartment.com/' target='_blank'>www.thecomedydepartment.com</a></b> </p> \n\n<iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/3Vkit0iWOH0?si=Mtw8sUacnXbL389s' title='YouTube video player' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>\n\n\n\n"
      }
    ],
