    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Tommy Charles"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "\n<p>Tommy Charles, based out of Edmonton, Alberta, is\nbringing a clean classic sound with natural vocals and\nrobust production to country Americana music. With his\nsignature deep, crooning vocals, Tommy's sound is both\nnostalgic and distinct.</p>\n<p>Raised in the Montréal area, Tommy's talent led to\nhim being a contestant on the hit TV show La Voix\n(The Voice). Since then, he has released his debut album\nSouthern Accent in 2023. Performing in Spanish, French,\nPortuguese, and English, Tommy revisits the classic\nsounds of artists like Marty Robbins, Roy Orbison, and\nSam Cooke. A natural performer, he frequently plays\nshows across Canada and Texas and is a can't-miss\nevent when he comes to your city! </p>\n\n<p><a href='https://linktr.ee/tommycharlesmusic' target='_blank'>tommycharlesmusic.com</a></p>\n\n"
      }
    ],
