    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprowest.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1699818356/performances/ANV31JM26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprowest.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1699818356/performances/ANV31JM26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "2026 Vancouver Fall Classic"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "This high-energy event will bring together the finest athletes from across Canada to display their dedication, discipline, and sculpted physiques.<br><br>\n\nWith its reputation as a premier event, the Vancouver Fall Classic  promises an unforgettable experience for both participants and spectators. The show aims to celebrate the artistry and athleticism of bodybuilding, as competitors showcase their years of training, commitment, and passion for the sport.<br><br>\n\nThe Vancouver Fall Classic will feature multiple categories, including Men's Bodybuilding, Women's Physique, Classic Physique, Figure, Wellness and Bikini. Contestants will be judged on their muscularity, symmetry, stage presence, and overall presentation, making it an exhilarating visual spectacle for enthusiasts and novices alike.<br><br>\n\nThis year's event boasts a panel of distinguished judges, composed of industry experts and IFBB Pro athletes, who will bring their extensive knowledge and expertise to ensure fair and impartial evaluations. The judging process will be conducted with the utmost professionalism and transparency, ensuring that the deserving champions are recognized for their extraordinary dedication and hard work.<br><br>\n\nIn addition to the competitive aspect, the Vancouver Fall Classic will also provide an opportunity for attendees to immerse themselves in the vibrant bodybuilding community. Industry-leading vendors and sponsors will be present in the Lobby, offering a wide range of products and services tailored to fitness enthusiasts and professionals alike.\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>\n"
      }
    ],
