      {
        "@value": "Ariana Whitlow - Divas Live! - DINNER & SHOW"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Join Ariana Whitlow as she sings the chart-topping hits of the greatest female vocalists in history, featuring songs you know and love by Whitney Houston, Celine Dion, Aretha Franklin, Tina Turner, Adele, and more...! DIVAS Live is a must-see for fans of the world's most celebrated female singers. In this high-energy, Vegas-style performance, Ariana uses her comedic personality and dynamic vocals to take her audience on a musical adventure through hilarious stories, timeless songs, and shimmering costumes.\n</p>\n\n<style>\n.titleTax {display: none !important;}\n</style>"
