    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprowest.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1691795678/performances/LSC02LS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Hotel California - Tribute to the Eagles"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>For over three decades, HOTEL CALIFORNIA has been recreating the legendary sound of the EAGLES and thrilling audiences all over the world.</p>\n\n<p>The band set the bar in 1986, and they've remained the industry-leading substitute for the Eagles ever since. Playing to huge outdoor and arena audiences, sharing bills with some of rock's legends, and going places no tribute band has gone before. A long run by any measure, but it begs the question: what makes HOTEL CALIFORNIA so special? Incredible lead vocal similarity, intensely accurate instrumental work, soaring harmonies, and top-flight live performances, just for starters. These are the band's hallmarks and the foundation on which their reputation has been built. With over a century of collective professional experience in the band today, they're still going stronger than ever!</p>\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n</style>"
      }
    ],
