      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Mystery Artist - Christmas Edition"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "\n<p>We can't tell you who it is... yet.</p>\n<p>This year's Mystery Artist is bringing a festive holiday\nconcert to Horizon Stage, but their identity will remain\nunder wraps for now. Tickets are on sale at a special\ndiscounted mystery price, giving you the chance to\nsecure your seat before the big reveal.</p>\n<p>We'll be sharing clues through social media, newsletters,\nand other channels. Follow along, make your guesses,\nand join the fun as we uncover the mystery together.\nThe artist will be revealed approximately two weeks\nbefore the performance, at which time ticket prices\nwill move to 'Price After Reveal' rate.</p>\n<p>Follow us for clues:<br>\n<a href='https://www.facebook.com/thehorizonstage/' target='_blank'>Facebook</a> | <a href='https://www.instagram.com/horizonstage/' target='_blank'>Instagram</a>\n</p>\n\n\n"
      }
    ],
