    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Silly Billy - The Chimera Project Dance Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "\n<p>Silly Billy is a unique family-friendly production that\ncelebrates the beauty of individuality through a vibrant\nblend of First Nations traditions, dance, and theatre.\nThe story follows Billy, a rare white buffalo who dreams\nof becoming a magical unicorn. Through a series of\nadventures, obstacles, and discoveries, Billy learns to\nembrace his uniqueness and finds his place as the\nlegendary great white buffalo of the plains.</p>\n<p>Infused with Indigenous hoop dancing, powwow dance,\ntheatre, music, and western dance styles including\nballet, jazz, contemporary, and hip hop, Silly Billy is a\njoyful journey of self-discovery. A post-show Q&A invites\naudiences to learn more about the cultural traditions and\ndiverse dance forms featured in the performance.</p>\n\n<p><a href='https://chimeradt.com/' target='_blank'>chimeradt.com</a></p>\n\n"
      }
    ],
