    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Bangs, Bobs & Banter - Confessions of a Hairstylist"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p><b><font color='#ff0000'>Contains Mature Themes and Language</font></b></p>\n\n<p>Created and performed by 12x award-winning artist\nJoanna Rannelli, Bangs, Bobs & Banter: Confessions of a\nHairstylist is a multi-award-winning one-woman comedy\nin which Rannelli brings 10+ unforgettable characters to\nlife. Winner of numerous festival honours and audience\nawards across North America, including Critics' Choice\nand Patrons' Pick at the Orlando International Fringe, this\nfast-paced 90-minute theatrical experience follows Nikki,\na bold and charismatic hairstylist whose colourful clients\nreveal sassy, saucy, scandalous, and surprisingly heartfelt\nstories inspired by real-life encounters. With multiple\nsold-out runs in Vancouver, Orlando, Stratford, and\nEdmonton, this hilarious and deeply human show leaves\naudiences laughing, moved and wanting more.</p>\n\n<p>'A star performance, expertly executed.' — <i>Centre Stage\nHamilton</i></p>\n\n<p>'Nikki's salon is absolutely hopping' —<i> Edmonton Journal</i></p>\n\n"
      }
    ],
