    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Double Bill: Terra Spencer and Ken Stead"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Two master storytellers share one intimate night at New Moon Folk Club as Terra Spencer and Ken Stead bring their songs under the same roof. Terra's butterscotch vocals, wry Maritime humour, and cinematic folk songs feel like leafing through a box of old letters, full of small details and big emotions. Ken's warm, roots‑folk anthems turn any room into a living room singalong, blending charged lyricism, lived experience, and easy banter with the crowd. Together they offer an evening of harmony, heart, and unforgettable stories—two full concerts, one cozy New Moon stage.</p>\n\n\n<style>\n.global-tax-label-temp{display:none;}\n\n.location-page-temp {\n    display: block!important;\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>"
      }
    ],
