      {
        "@value": "<p>Presented by the Vancouver Chamber Music Society</p>\n\n<p>Stobbe & Williamson explore transformation and tradition in works by Biber, Stravinsky, and Beethoven</p>\n\t\t\t\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>\n"
