      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Trio Fibonacci"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p><b>Subscriptions on sale July 1: <a href=' https://okpas.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1694091714' target='_blank'>click here to buy!</a> - Invdividual shows on sale September 1, 2026.</b></p><p>Close out the season with a world-class chamber music experience as Montréal's acclaimed Trio Fibonacci graces our stage for an evening of breathtaking artistry and musical intimacy. Acclaimed internationally for their brilliant and elegant performances, Trio Fibonacci — comprising violin, cello, and piano — offer thematic programming that beautifully combines classical, romantic, and contemporary works. Guided by some of the world's most respected chamber musicians and having performed at venues from the Musée d'Orsay in Paris to the Forbidden City Concert Hall in Beijing, this ensemble brings a rare level of poise, passion, and virtuosity to every performance. A perfect evening for anyone who appreciates music at its most refined — and a truly fitting finale to a remarkable season. </p>\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n</style>"
      }
